{"sha": "20224f1e4c29e861f6bf4309d9c55160c3a91616eecff357ba38d215439b842d", "body": ["\\section*{第 \\ref{ch:g3:mult} 章 --- 乘法}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g3:mult:1}", "$8 + 8 + 8 + 8 = 4 \\times 8 = 32$; \\quad", "$5 + 5 + 5 = 3 \\times 5 = 15$; \\quad", "$20 \\times 5 = 100$.", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g3:mult:2}", "$42$; \\quad $32$; \\quad $81$; \\quad $56$; \\quad $36$.", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g3:mult:3}", "两个长方形都包含相同的 $24$ 个点 --- 一个只是", "另一个侧放过来的样子：$4 \\times 6 = 6 \\times 4$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g3:mult:4}", "$560$; \\quad $800$; \\quad $0$; \\quad $45$; \\quad $300$.", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g3:mult:5}", "$132 \\times 3 = 396$; \\quad", "$217 \\times 4 = 868$; \\quad", "$408 \\times 7 = 2\\,856$.", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g3:mult:6}", "$31 \\times 5 = 30 \\times 5 + 5 = 155$; \\quad", "$42 \\times 3 = 120 + 6 = 126$; \\quad", "$25 \\times 6 = 20 \\times 6 + 5 \\times 6 = 120 + 30 = 150$.", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g3:mult:7}", "$99 \\times 7 = 700 - 7 = 693$; \\quad", "$101 \\times 6 = 600 + 6 = 606$; \\quad", "$98 \\times 5 = 500 - 10 = 490$.", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g3:mult:8}", "$389 \\times 5$：估算 $400 \\times 5 = 2\\,000$；精确值", "$1\\,945$.", "", "$612 \\times 8$：估算 $600 \\times 8 = 4\\,800$；精确值 $4\\,896$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g3:mult:9}", "$38 \\times 6 = 228$。箱子里共有 $228$ 个鸡蛋。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g3:mult:10}", "课桌：$8 \\times 4 = 32$。学生：$32 \\times 2 = 64$。这个教室可以", "容纳 $64$ 名学生。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g3:mult:11}", "在乘法表中，$24$ 可以写成 $1 \\times 24$、$2 \\times 12$，", "$3 \\times 8$、$4 \\times 6$ --- 以及这些数对颠倒后的形式。可能的", "排列方式有：$1$ 行，每行 $24$ 个；$2$ 行，每行 $12$ 个；$3$ 行，每行 $8$ 个；", "$4$ 行，每行 $6$ 个；$6$ 行，每行 $4$ 个；$8$ 行，每行 $3$ 个；$12$ 行，每行 $2$ 个；", "$24$ 行，每行 $1$ 个。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g3:mult:12}", "佐伊把 $47$ 拆成 $40 + 7$（心算时的竖式思路）；莱雅", "把 $47$ 换成好算的整十数 $50$，再减去多算了的", "$3 \\times 6$。对于 $38 \\times 4$，佐伊的方法是", "$120 + 32 = 152$；莱雅的方法是 $40 \\times 4 - 2 \\times 4 = 160 - 8 =", "152$。两种方法都正确 --- 这里莱雅的方法更快，因为 $38$ 与", "$40$.", "\\end{solution}", ""]}